# MODAL-03 — Focus management (trap + restore)

## Rationale

Focus must move into the modal, stay trapped while open, and return to the trigger on close.

## How to check

Read the JS controlling open/close; verify focus is moved in, trapped, and restored.

## How to fix

Propose focus-trap logic and storing/restoring the trigger element.
